<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viscātus</span></b> , a, um,
			Part. [id.], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>smeared with birdlime</i>: virgae, <i>limed twigs.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 3, 7, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 15, 474</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					A. 1, 391</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: omnia viscatis manibus leget,
			Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 332, 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">396,
				4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viscata beneficia devitare,</span>”
				i.e. <i>entangling</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 8, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">munera,</span>”
				i.e. <i>for which one expects a good return</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 9, 30, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
